99	/// `sl<AuthCubit>()`/`sl<SessionRepository>()`/`sl<VaultRepository>()`,
100	/// building the one `go_router` (Story 1.6; AD-14's vault gate), and
101	/// wrapping it with `ExpiryOverlayHost` — actually works end to end. Every
102	/// other test either stops at DI registration
